            "review_text": "D7121TBericp\nMontreal, Canada2 contributions\n0\nExcellent sushis\nApr 2018 • Couples\nWe've been to a couple of sushi bars in our trip all across Vietnam (SaiGon to Hanoi), and we can guarantee that this place is the best so far. The quality of the food is awesome and we only took common stuff (I believe the specialities are great).\n\nIt's a bit pricy, but I guess you got to pay a little more (like back home) to have god quality. \n\nForget the other restaurants, this is the place in Hanoi.\n\nThe restaurant is beautiful and the service was okay!\nRead more\nWritten April 1, 2018",
